                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "488c531b-a9a4-39d2-bbf4-01827d2d290e",
                        "entry_id": "227ef855-8bf2-317b-b46d-fb2b4d49ecb4",
                        "glosses": [
                            "In a replenishing manner."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "21bca4f8-293a-402a-abf1-09ae86aa5a7f",
                                "sense_id": "488c531b-a9a4-39d2-bbf4-01827d2d290e",
                                "text": "Thirdly, and laſtly, the maner of God his being alone, is to be in euerieplace indefinitiuely, repletiuely, or repleniſhingly.[…]Neither yet indefinitiuely, repletiuely, or repleniſhingly: for that, manner of placing doth properly and peculiarly belong vnto God, who is onely of an infinite and incomprehenſible being, whereas the diuell is a finite and circumſcriptible creature."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "404da2f4-e4d9-4554-8a5c-85f202e380f3",
                                "sense_id": "488c531b-a9a4-39d2-bbf4-01827d2d290e",
                                "text": "God is repleniſhingly every where: but moſt contractedly, and workingly in the Temple."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "9ec1780a-939e-4e2b-9ce1-c2e4a46de9fe",
                                "sense_id": "488c531b-a9a4-39d2-bbf4-01827d2d290e",
                                "text": "What do the candidates favor as a revenue replenishingly measure?"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ee99b278-20b5-47fc-85e4-e6342c064f8b",
                                "sense_id": "488c531b-a9a4-39d2-bbf4-01827d2d290e",
                                "text": "But I doubt if seeing a kind of battle between a gradually declining cool style and an, at first, replenishingly hot one is the best way to look at the past ten years in jazz."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "536685de-8d39-436b-9cfb-3a0e0f6f3812",
                                "sense_id": "488c531b-a9a4-39d2-bbf4-01827d2d290e",
                                "text": "Self-starters should only be used / To gear into the replenishingly regenerative powers / Of the main engine."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "154418da-0c9f-4fe4-b8d3-06ab2b8eaf91",
                                "sense_id": "488c531b-a9a4-39d2-bbf4-01827d2d290e",
                                "text": "The first sheet feed tray unit is in a backward rising inclination and replenishingly accommodates therein a plurality of sheets."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "40cf7fc7-45ea-48d1-acec-6da43deeda51",
                                "sense_id": "488c531b-a9a4-39d2-bbf4-01827d2d290e",
                                "text": "Jesus does not say sell you the kingdom. He does not say trade you the kingdom. He says it is the Father’s good pleasure to give you the kingdom. God is a mountain spring and not a watering trough. He wells up self-replenishingly."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "4b9ff6ff-4e46-4095-8bce-696b7f9358cc",
                                "sense_id": "488c531b-a9a4-39d2-bbf4-01827d2d290e",
                                "text": "But the biggest influence on David’s deadpan is Jerry Seinfeld’s deadpan, an impermeable expression of suburban complacency that says: “This is just too crazy to be real!” This represents an absolute inversion of the comedy of Lenny Bruce, or George Carlin, or even the tamer but still subtly subversive Robert Klein, the guiding sentiment of all of whom was: “This is too alarmingly real to be replenishingly crazy!”"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a9559989-0cfd-4956-8949-7fb4f2dda255",
                                "sense_id": "488c531b-a9a4-39d2-bbf4-01827d2d290e",
                                "text": "We laughed as we used to laugh, deeply and replenishingly."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "34e47369-7192-485b-bd1a-323482fa33d8",
                                "sense_id": "488c531b-a9a4-39d2-bbf4-01827d2d290e",
                                "text": "It is as though the immensity were a fountain that continually, self-replenishingly fructifies, perpetuating itself."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "e2051b6a-6cab-4209-99b0-d24a406cb8cd",
                                "sense_id": "488c531b-a9a4-39d2-bbf4-01827d2d290e",
                                "text": "What do you breathe in, fundamentally and replenishingly, in the moments of greatest personal need, to equip you in turning toward others?"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "b7a33740-fb59-43c5-a2fa-6ad2c5b44667",
                                "sense_id": "488c531b-a9a4-39d2-bbf4-01827d2d290e",
                                "text": "\"It was replenishingly transformational, magical, trippy, emotional, and FUN making this piece of music with my dear friends,\" she [Kacey Musgraves] says of the album in an Instagram post."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "7e9523bf-9aa2-4da4-b27a-77f88d7e1d67",
                                "sense_id": "488c531b-a9a4-39d2-bbf4-01827d2d290e",
                                "text": "That the more joy we share, the more joy fills us, self-replenishingly, until it boils up ebullient and flows out effortlessly."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
